  "recipe": {
    "composition": "A black terminal window: three window dots at the top left, a hairline above the footer, text flush left. Cover, chapter and closing titles are large green monospace; chapter and closing titles sit behind a drawn // prompt. Write short command-like kickers such as `$ whoami`.",
    "components": "Thin green-bordered dark panels, green mono stat values, numbered panels for steps, a code panel for traces and commands. Green is the signal colour, amber and red only for warnings.",
    "narrative": "Who am I, setup, out-of-box numbers, real trace, benchmark, verdict, try it yourself, exit.",
    "nativeCoverage": "Cover, chapter, stat panels, code panels, bar chart, two-panel comparison and closing as native text, shapes and chart. Not reproduced: the blinking typing cursor, green text glow, tag chips, coloured trace syntax, outlined translucent chart bars, JetBrains Mono (Consolas is used; Chinese titles fall back to a sans face)."
  },
